      "remarks": [
        "Prostate cancer death arises only here, in the metastatic",
        "castration-resistant arm, at 25%/yr. A 0.25 annual hazard gives a median",
        "survival from castration resistance of ln(0.5)/ln(0.75) = 2.4 years,",
        "matching contemporary mCRPC survival: TAX327 median OS 18.9 months",
        "(Tannock, NEJM 2004) extended to roughly 2.5-3 years by abiraterone and",
        "enzalutamide; SEER 2018-2022 distant-stage 5-year relative survival ~37%.",
        "An earlier draft used 5%/yr, which implies a 13.5-year median survival",
        "and understated cause-specific mortality roughly four-fold.",
        "",
        "Everyone else leaves this module through a discharge EncounterEnd and",
        "dies of a competing cause handled by the lifecycle module. The",
        "pre-2026-08 module funnelled every diagnosed man into",
        "Death_From_Prostate_Cancer."
